// REQUIRES: long, host-linux-amd64 || host-linux-arm64
// SPLIT: units-shared-routes 3/4
// RUN: %python %S/Inputs/gen-shared-units.py --run %gopp --full --jobs 8 --shard 3/4 | FileCheck %s
// The long form of units-shared-routes.test: every chain of depth 0 to 3 of
// the routes, with every leaf, both carriers (W[U], float64[U]), both orders,
// -build-check-j 1 and 16. In 4 parts that run side by side: part K has the
// programs whose place in the list is K - 1 modulo 4 (together 8844 cases,
// 8040 refused, 1079 programs built 4 times each; units-shared-routes.long.test checks that the
// parts are the list, each program once).
// CHECK: 2160 cases (2016 refused), 1080 programs
// CHECK-NEXT: OK
